      "created_at": "2025-04-24T04:41:50.695Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, im very new to the erpnext and frappe family. I have a couple of pains, most of them regarding navigation.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Sidebar should have more dropdowns/links. Why only Accounting have this useful dropdown. For instance, Stock should have warehouses, products, UOM, inventory.</li>\n<li>Floating pages. It took me ages to find POS. In spanish “punto de venta” didn’t throw any matches at the nav-bar. Besides, I was hoping to find it under sales, but just configuration for it was there.</li>\n<li>Why not go ham with sidebar? Surely there is a way to add multiple modules and this subcategories with some modifications, but why not go the SAP Business One route, just nest the heck out of it with navigation submenus/links.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/7/b7c732b2482eaa6d50b0e4d8889a6316772ac670.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b7c732b2482eaa6d50b0e4d8889a6316772ac670\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/7/b7c732b2482eaa6d50b0e4d8889a6316772ac670_2_217x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"qdM9J9SDlcNfMTTIGqZ3eMUk8a4\" width=\"217\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/7/b7c732b2482eaa6d50b0e4d8889a6316772ac670_2_217x500.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/7/b7c732b2482eaa6d50b0e4d8889a6316772ac670_2_325x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/7/b7c732b2482eaa6d50b0e4d8889a6316772ac670.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"D6EBF2\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">374×860 52.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></li>\n<li>Default theme on low contrast devices is very confusing. I made a small css snippet to run on my browser to somewhat remediate this. I don’t know how to make it into a theme however. Will simple customizations in this regard something planned (like changing the accent color, or the nav bar bg color)?<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/a/9a197aff25f23efd7011cbdbab6f1167c99f81d1.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9a197aff25f23efd7011cbdbab6f1167c99f81d1\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/a/9a197aff25f23efd7011cbdbab6f1167c99f81d1_2_690x336.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"lZe7zfBWxIdwOUJMWwy8mmtYhod\" width=\"690\" height=\"336\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/a/9a197aff25f23efd7011cbdbab6f1167c99f81d1_2_690x336.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/a/9a197aff25f23efd7011cbdbab6f1167c99f81d1_2_1035x504.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/a/9a197aff25f23efd7011cbdbab6f1167c99f81d1_2_1380x672.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FBFBFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2970×1450 283 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></li>\n</ol>\n<p>This wont hurt the existing workflow since it would be like Accounting thing, click on the name for the dashboard, click on the arrow to see more options.</p>\n<p>Is this something planned? wanted even? im glad to help or adjust it for my own, but I haven’t managed to find how to add more workspaces or submenus with raw configuration. Can someone point me in the right direction?</p>",
